'''Landing Platform Nine''',<ref name="IT">{{EncyclopediaCite|Imperial Troops}}</ref> also known as '''landing pad nine'''<ref name="UVG">''[[Star Wars: Rogue One: The Ultimate Visual Guide]]''</ref> or '''platform 9''',<ref name="THoRO">{{EncyclopediaCite|The Heroes of Rogue One}}</ref> was the ninth landing pad at the [[Imperial Center of Military Research]] on [[Scarif]]. Prior to the [[Battle of Scarif]], the stolen [[Zeta-class Heavy Cargo Shuttle|''Zeta''-class Heavy Cargo Shuttle]] ''[[SW-0608]]'' piloted by the [[Alliance to Restore the Republic|rebel]] [[squad]] "[[Rogue One]]" landed on landing pad nine.<ref name="UVG" /><ref name="Rogue One" />

An [[Galactic Empire|Imperial]] inspection team arrived via the tram and headed inside the cargo [[shuttle]], only to find that there were hidden rebels, and was ambushed and [[Death|killed]]. Then, a [[Coastal defender stormtrooper|shoretrooper]] threw a [[C-25 fragmentation grenade|fragmentation grenade]] inside the cargo [[shuttle]], destroying the entire vehicle and creating extensive damage to the [[Hangar|landing pad]].<ref name="Rogue One" />

